<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Providian upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Providian upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Monday it had raised its rating for Providian Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The life insurance company's stock rose one point to 54-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
